-- mad_over_time(up[3m]): the median absolute deviation of the in-range samples, drops the metric name.
-- host1 = 10 (median 20, deviations 10/0/10), host2 = 10 (median 15, deviations 10/0/10), host3 = 0, host5 = nan (a sample is NaN).
-- host4's only sample is older than the window, so it is dropped.
[('instance','host1')]	2023-11-14 22:13:20.000	10
[('instance','host2')]	2023-11-14 22:13:20.000	10
[('instance','host3')]	2023-11-14 22:13:20.000	0
[('instance','host5')]	2023-11-14 22:13:20.000	nan
